@host = http://localhost:3000

### Register New User (Identity API)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login User (Cookie Authentication)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login?useCookies=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Assign Professional Role (Auth Controller)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/assign-professional
Accept: application/json

### Google Login Challenge
GET {{host}}/api/auth/login/google

### Logout User
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
